{"instruction": "Write a q function named xn that perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "xn:{$[.5>x;0-.z.s 1-x;.92>x;\n (x*2.50662823884+l*-18.61500062529+l*41.39119773534+l*-25.44106049637)%1+l*-8.47351093090+l*23.08336743743+l*-21.06224101826+3.13082909833*l:x*x-:.5;\n 0.3374754822726147+l*0.9761690190917186+l*0.1607979714918209+l*0.0276438810333863+l*0.0038405729373609+l*0.0003951896511919+l*0.0000321767881768+l*0.0000002888167364+0.0000003960315187*l:log 0-log 1-x]}"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function nor that perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "nor:{$[x=2*n:x div 2;raze sqrt[-2*log n?1f]*/:(sin;cos)@\\:(2*pi)*n?1f;-1_.z.s 1+x]}"}
