{"instruction": "How do I write a q function that perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "tradedata:{[numrows]\n  time:numrows#.z.p;\n  sym:numrows?`AUDUSD`EURUSD`USDCHF;\n  price:10+numrows?100.0;\n  size:`int$1000*price;\n  stop:numrows?0b;\n  cond:numrows?\"ABK\";\n  ex:numrows?\"NO\";\n  side:numrows?`buy`sell;\n  `xdailyt set ([]time;`g#sym;price;size;stop;cond;ex;side);\n }"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function quotedata that perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "quotedata:{[numrows]\n  time:numrows#.z.p;\n  sym:numrows?`AUDUSD`EURUSD`USDCHF;\n  bid:10+numrows?100.0;\n  ask:bid*1.1;\n  bsize:`long$100*bid;\n  asize:`long$10*bsize;\n  mode:numrows?\" YRL\";\n  ex:numrows?\"NO\";\n  src:numrows?`GETGO`DB`SUN;\n  `xdailyq set ([]time;`g#sym;bid;ask;asize;bsize;mode;ex;src);\n }"}
