{"instruction": "Implement a function loaddata that load data from files or databases", "input": "", "output": "loaddata:{[loadparams;rawdata]\n\n .lg.o[`dataloader;\"reading in data chunk\"];\n \n // check if we have already read some data from this file\n // if this is the first time we've seen it, then the first row\n // may contain the header information\n // in both cases we want to return a table with the same column names\n data:$[not loadparams[`filename] in filesread;\n\t   // it hasn't been seen - the first row may or may not be column headers\n\t   [filesread,::loadparams[`filename];\n\t    loadparams[`headers] xcol $[0h>type loadparams[`separator];{flip x!y}"}
{"instruction": "How do I write a q function that filter data based on conditions", "input": "", "output": "writedatapartition:{[dbdir;partition;partitiontype;partitioncol;tablename;data]\n // sub-select the data to write\n towrite:data where partition=partitiontype$data partitioncol;\n \n // generate the write path\n writepath:` sv .Q.par[dbdir;partition;tablename],`;\n .lg.o[`dataloader;\"writing \",(string count towrite),\" rows to \",string writepath];\n \n // splay the table - use an error trap\n .[upsert;(writepath;towrite);{.lg.e[`dataloader;\"failed to save table: \",x]}"}
{"instruction": "Write a q function named finish that filter data based on conditions", "input": "", "output": "finish:{[loadparams]\n \n if[count loadparams`compression;\n\t.lg.o[`dataloader;\"setting compression parameters to \",\" \" sv string loadparams`compression];\n\t.dotz.set[`.z.zd;loadparams`compression]];\n // re-sort and set attributes on each partition\n {.sort.sorttab(x;where partitions[;0]=x)}"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function format that format data for output", "input": "", "output": "format:{[name;data]\n    (`name`data)!(name;data)\n  }"}
{"instruction": "Show me how to implement execdict in q/kdb+", "input": "", "output": "execdict:{\n  $[all `start_date`end_date`region_filter`custtype_filter`grouping`pivot in key x;\n    [\n      sd:\"D\"$x[`start_date];\n      ed:\"D\"$x[`end_date];\n      gr:$[any raze null each x[`grouping];();`$x[`grouping]];\n      pv:$[\"none\"~x[`pivot];();`$x[`pivot]];\n      rf:$[any raze null each x[`region_filter];();`$x[`region_filter]];\n      cf:$[any raze null each x[`custtype_filter];();`$x[`custtype_filter]];\n\n      // Run function using params\n      data:.[{[sd;ed;rf;cf;gr;pv] timeit[`usagereport;(sd;ed;rf;cf;gr;pv);outputrows]}"}
{"instruction": "Write a q function named evaluate that execute a query and return results", "input": "", "output": "evaluate:{@[execdict;x;{(enlist `error)!(enlist x)}"}
{"instruction": "Create a q/kdb+ function ws to perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "ws:{neg[.z.w] -8!.j.j[evaluate[.j.k -9!x]];}"}
{"instruction": "Write q code for pathtotable to perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "pathtotable:{[h;p;t] `$(string .Q.par[h;partitiontype$p;t]),\"/\"}"}
{"instruction": "How do I write a q function that perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "createemptytable:{[h;p;t;td]\n $[partandmerge;dest:td;dest:h];\n if[(not (path:pathtotable[dest;p;t]) in .replay.emptytabs) and .replay.emptytables;\n  .lg.o[`replay;\"creating empty table \",(string t),\" at \",string path];\n  .replay.emptytabs,:path;\n  savetabdatatrapped[h;p;t;0#value t;0b;td]]}"}
{"instruction": "Write a q function named savetabdata that save data to disk", "input": "", "output": "savetabdata:{[h;p;t;data;UPSERT;td]\n $[partandmerge;path:pathtotable[td;p;t];path:pathtotable[h;p;t]];\n if[not partandmerge;.lg.o[`replay;\"saving table \",(string t),\" to \",string path]];\n .replay.pathlist[t],:path;\n $[partandmerge;savetablesbypart[td;p;t;h];$[UPSERT;upsert;set] . (path;.Q.en[h;0!.save.manipulate[t;data]])]\n  }"}
{"instruction": "How do I write a q function that save data to disk", "input": "", "output": "savetabdatatrapped:{[h;p;t;data;UPSERT;td] .[savetabdata;(h;p;t;data;UPSERT;td);{.lg.e[`replay;\"failed to save table : \",x]}"}
{"instruction": "Write q code for savetab to save data to disk", "input": "", "output": "savetab:{[td;h;p;t]\n if[not partandmerge;createemptytable[h;p;t;td]];\n if[count value t;\n  .lg.o[`replay;\"saving \",(string t),\" which has row count \",string count value t];\n  savetabdatatrapped[h;p;t;value t;1b;td];\n  delete from t;\n  if[gc;.gc.run[]]]}"}
{"instruction": "Create a q/kdb+ function getattributes to retrieve data", "input": "", "output": "getattributes:{`partition`tables!(.rdb.getpartition[],();tables[])}"}
