{"instruction": "How do I write a q function that calculate aggregate statistics", "input": "", "output": "tick:{init[];if[not min(`time`sym~2#key flip value@)each t;'`timesym];@[;`sym;`g#]each t;d::.z.D;if[l::count y;L::`$\":\",y,\"/\",x,10#\".\";l::ld d]}"}
