{"instruction": "Create a q/kdb+ function upd to perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "upd:{[t;x]\n if[not -16=type first first x;if[d<\"d\"$a:.z.P;.z.ts[]];a:\"p\"$a;x:$[0>type first x;a,x;(enlist(count first x)#a),x]];\n t insert x;if[l;l enlist (`upd;t;x);j+:1];}"}
