{"instruction": "How do I write a q function that retrieve data", "input": "", "output": "getusage:{@[value;`.proc.usage;generalusage,\"\\n\\n\",envusage,\"\\n\\n\",envoptusage,\"\\n\\n\",stdoptionusage,\"\\n\\n\",extrausage,\"\\n\\n\",configusage,\"\\n\\n\",helpusage,\"\\n\\n\"]}"}
