{"instruction": "Show me how to implement settorqenv in q/kdb+", "input": "", "output": "settorqenv:{[envvar; default] \n if[\"\"~getenv[envvar]; \n  .lg.o[`init;(string envvar),\" is not defined. Defining it to \",val:qhome[],\"/\",default];\t\n  setenv[envvar; val]];}"}
{"instruction": "Create a q/kdb+ function checkvers to validate data", "input": "", "output": "checkvers:{[i;j;d;t]\n    {[i;j;d;t;x]$[(\"I\"$i[x])<\"I\"$j[x];x:6;(\"I\"$i[x])>\"I\"$j[x];[.lg.e[`config;(raze/) string t[`app],\" \",string t[`version],\" requires \",string d,\" \",sv[\".\";i],\". Current Version is \",string d,\" \",sv[\".\";j]];x:6];x+:1]}"}
