{"instruction": "Show me how to implement grad in q/kdb+", "input": "", "output": "grad:{[gradient] -1+2*gradient>count[gradient]?1f}"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function profile that calculate aggregate statistics", "input": "", "output": "profile:{[b;g] (0f,sums 0|b+noise[count g]+sums grad[g]) samples}"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function genprofile that perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "genprofile:{[id]\n \n /- get the profile for the id, given the starting point \n p:currentusage[id]+profile[baseusage[id;0];gradients[baseusage[id;1]]];\n \n /- store the usage\n currentusage[id]:last p;\n \n /- return the profile, drop the last value\n -1 _ p}"}
{"instruction": "Write q code for datechk to perform data operations", "input": "", "output": "datechk:{[]\n  .lg.o[`datechk;\"Checking if latest date in hdb is corect\"]; \n  if[not `PV in key`.Q;\n    .lg.o[`datechk;\"The directory is not partitioned\"];\n    :(0b;\"The directory is not partitioned\")];\n  if[not `date in .Q.pf;\n    .lg.o[`datechk;\"date is not a partition field value\"];\n    :(0b;\"date is not a partition field value\")];\n  c:(last .Q.pv)=.z.d-1+k*(k:.z.d mod 7)in 0 1;\n  (c;\"Latest date in hdb is \", $[c;\"correct\";\"not correct\"])\n  }"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function setup that initialize or configure the system", "input": "", "output": "setup:{[respath;testname]\n  .os.md each (respath;rp:respath,string[.z.d],\"/\");\n  if[not 11h=type key hsym `$logpath:raze rp,\"/logs/\";.os.md logpath];\n  .proc.createlog[logpath;testname;`$ssr[string .z.p;\"[D.:]\";\"_\"];0b];\n  }"}
{"instruction": "Implement a function handlesandfiles that process incoming data", "input": "", "output": "handlesandfiles:{[dir;filename]\n  h:hopen f:hsym `$dir,\"/\",filename;\n  if[not hcount f;.lg.o[`writeres;\"Creating file \",1_string f]];\n  :(h;f)\n  }"}
